{"id":"fced0c3529ef3729","group":"72","path":"72/72-lem-cut-reduction.md","title":"Cut Reduction Lemma","display":"lem-cut-reduction — Cut Reduction Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-lem-cut-reduction","aliases":["72-lem-cut-reduction"],"display":"lem-cut-reduction — Cut Reduction Lemma","depends_on":["[[72-df-gentzen-system]]","[[72-df-proof-tree]]","[[72-df-cut-degree]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §2.4.2.1 print37–40/PDF49–52; explicit principal-conjunction specialization","verification_status":"local principal-conjunction construction checked; other principal cases not encoded","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-lem-cut-reduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-lem-cut-reduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-cut-reduction — Cut Reduction Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c60a11e47ac58326\" href=\"?note=c60a11e47ac58326\" title=\"72-df-gentzen-system\">72-df-gentzen-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-tree\">72-df-proof-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"715dbcdaf4fc3a32\" href=\"?note=715dbcdaf4fc3a32\" title=\"72-df-cut-degree\">72-df-cut-degree</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §2.4.2.1 print37–40/PDF49–52; explicit principal-conjunction specialization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local principal-conjunction construction checked; other principal cases not encoded"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LK}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LK}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 均取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c60a11e47ac58326\" href=\"?note=c60a11e47ac58326\" title=\"72-df-gentzen-system\">72-df-gentzen-system</a> 的实际序列演算；没有另加非逻辑初始式，逻辑等号没有额外公理。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-tree\">72-df-proof-tree</a> 的有限五元带标签证明集合。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathrm{LK}_\\Sigma}\">\\(\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathrm{LK}_\\Sigma}\\)</span> 的根标签为cut，切公式为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=B\\land C\">\\(A=B\\land C\\)</span>；第0前提末规则为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\land R\">\\(\\land R\\)</span>、第1前提末规则为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\land L\">\\(\\land L\\)</span>，其主公式出现正是这两个切公式出现。其他切公式秩均小于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rk}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{rk}(A)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d=\\operatorname{rk}(A)+1\">\\(d=\\operatorname{rk}(A)+1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q=\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)\">\\(q=\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\pi&#39;\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathrm{LK}_\\Sigma}\\ (\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi&#39;)=q\\land\\operatorname{CutDeg}(\\pi&#39;)&lt;d).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\pi&#39;\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathrm{LK}_\\Sigma}\\ (\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi&#39;)=q\\land\\operatorname{CutDeg}(\\pi&#39;)&lt;d).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是具体主合取切归约：先用左侧B分支与右侧B,C前提作B切，再用左侧C分支作C切，最后交换/收缩重复上下文；新切只有B、C，秩都小于B∧C。保留原子有限树子证明并重新给η标签即可得到真实π′。旧NewCuts_c未定义、π′未量化，且笼统覆盖全部联结词；本条现给完全明确的合取主切实例。其他主切分支由源§2.4.2讨论，本原子没有把其完整局部机制冒称已编码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-gentzen-system","status":"resolved","id":"c60a11e47ac58326","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-gentzen-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"81c9c855e009a6d4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-proof-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-cut-degree","status":"resolved","id":"715dbcdaf4fc3a32","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-cut-degree]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-gentzen-system","status":"resolved","id":"c60a11e47ac58326","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma$、$\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LK}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}_\\Sigma$ 均取 [[72-df-gentzen-system]] 的实际序列演算；没有另加非逻辑初始式，逻辑等号没有额外公理。$\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C$ 是 [[72-df-proof-tree]] 的有限五元带标签证明集合。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"81c9c855e009a6d4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma$、$\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LK}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}_\\Sigma$ 均取 [[72-df-gentzen-system]] 的实际序列演算；没有另加非逻辑初始式，逻辑等号没有额外公理。$\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C$ 是 [[72-df-proof-tree]] 的有限五元带标签证明集合。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LK}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathrm{LK}_\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"A=B\\land C","display":false},{"tex":"\\land R","display":false},{"tex":"\\land L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{rk}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"d=\\operatorname{rk}(A)+1","display":false},{"tex":"q=\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists\\pi'\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathrm{LK}_\\Sigma}\\ (\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi')=q\\land\\operatorname{CutDeg}(\\pi')<d).","display":true}],"bytes":1947,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-176","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-lem-cut-reduction|lem-cut-reduction — Cut Reduction Lemma]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-174","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[lem-cut-reduction — Cut Reduction Lemma](72-lem-cut-reduction.md)"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-176","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-lem-cut-reduction|lem-cut-reduction — Cut Reduction Lemma]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-374","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-lem-cut-reduction]]"}],"outgoing":["c60a11e47ac58326","81c9c855e009a6d4","715dbcdaf4fc3a32"]}